le/network/network.tf\ngit commit -m \"test: verify VCS workflow with test tag\"\ngit push origin test/vcs-workflow\n\n# Go to GitHub and open PR\n# Watch HCP Terraform automatically run plan!\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🎓 **What You'll Experience:**\n\n### **When you open PR:**\n- 🤖 HCP Terraform bot comments on PR\n- 📊 Shows full `terraform plan` output\n- ✅ Shows what will change: \"1 to change, 0 to add, 0 to destroy\"\n- 👥 Team can review before merge\n\n### **When you merge PR:**\n- 🚀 HCP Terraform queues apply\n- ⏸️ Waits for your approval (if auto-apply disabled)\n- 🔘 You click \"Confirm & Apply\" in UI\n- ✨ Infrastructure updates automatically\n\n### **Benefits:**\n- ✅ No more manual `terraform plan`\n- ✅ No more manual `terraform apply`\n- ✅ Full audit trail in Git\n- ✅ Team collaboration via PRs\n- ✅ Safe - review before apply\n- ✅ Production-grade workflow\n\n---\n\n## 🔥 **Real Production Example:**\n\n**Scenario:** Fix the ALB security group issue\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create feature branch\ngit checkout -b feature/fix-alb-security-group\n\n# 2. Make changes (I'll help you with this)\n# 3. Commit and push\n# 4. Open PR on GitHub\n# 5. HCP Terraform runs plan automatically\n# 6. Review plan in PR comments\n# 7. Merge PR\n# 8. Approve apply in HCP Terraform\n# 9. ALB security group created! 🎉\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📚 **Documentation Created:**\n\n1. **VCS-WORKFLOW-SETUP.md** - Complete guide with:\n   - Step-by-step setup instructions\n   - Workflow diagram\n   - Example fixes\n   - Troubleshooting\n   - Security best practices\n\n2. **VCS-QUICK-REF.md** - Quick reference with:\n   - Common commands\n   - Commit conventions\n   - Important links\n   - Workflow states\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 **Your Action Items:**\n\n1. **Push the guides** (when network is back):\n   ```bash\n   cd /mnt/s/terraform/modules\n   git push origin master\n   ```\n\n2. **Connect GitHub to HCP Terraform** (follow VCS-WORKFLOW-SETUP.md)\n\n3. **Test with small change** (add a tag to VPC)\n\n4. **Fix ALB security group** using VCS workflow\n\n---\n\n**Ready to experience production-grade GitOps? This is how Netflix, Airbnb, and other tech companies manage infrastructure! 🚀**\n\nWant me to help you with the HCP Terraform setup, or shall we proceed with fixing the ALB security group issue first?"
